# TC-MOB-106 的执行指令
#
# 跑法（需 owner 授权仿真器）：
# DSH_CONNECT=relay ./test/run.sh run test/cases/current/106-过程折叠已完成轮次.md
#
# `{{session}}` 是运行器新建的临时会话（front matter 声明了 `临时目录:`），跑完删除。

1  do: 连接本机 DSH, 打开页面 transcript args="-DSHOpenSession,{{session}},-DSHProbeProcessFoldFixture" | want: id:chat.transcript
2  do: 等待 2 秒 | want: id:row.process.turn.1, id:row.user, id:row.assistant; absent id:row.tool | shot: 01-folded check=content,amber
3  do: 点击 id:row.process.turn.1, 等待 1 秒 | want: id:row.tool | shot: 02-expanded check=content,amber
4  do: 点击 id:row.process.turn.1, 等待 1 秒 | want: id:row.user, id:row.assistant; absent id:row.tool | shot: 03-collapsed-again check=content,amber
